<<luciBack characterSprite>>
lucifer: thanks for the show. and, y'know, for getting all that stuff cleaned up.

<<chipShirtless characterSprite>>
chip: yeah, yeah. it's no sweat off my back.

<<luciNeutral characterSprite>>
lucifer: ehehe... i did actually have one other thing i wanted to ask your help with.

<<chipShirtless characterSprite>>
chip: are you serious? dude. meowr's not a maid-for-hire app now,  is it?

<<luciNeutral characterSprite>>
lucifer: no, no, no, it'll be quick! and i'll help.

<<empty characterSprite>>
narrator: chip leans back against the wall.

<<chipShirtless characterSprite>>
chip: you better. what is it?

<<luciNeutral characterSprite>>
lucifer: i just need you to help me put some dishes away. that's all! then we can... y'know.

<<luciNeutral characterSprite>>
lucifer: i'll take 'em out of the dishwasher, you put them in the cabinet that i can't reach. easy! just, like. don't drop them.

<<chipShirtless characterSprite>>
chip: mhm. this is it, though? no other requests from his highness?

<<luciBack characterSprite>>
lucifer: haha! yeah, yeah, i promise.

<<chipPeace characterSprite>>
chip: good. i'll hold you to that.

